Story: Your first tower
  As a commander of a team
  I want to take a tower from the app
  So that I learn how to give orders

  The game is a practice game, where nobody commands Red. You select a drone and send it to the
  west tower. The drone takes off, flies to the tower and circles it until the tower is yours.

  Scenario: Take the west tower
    When the commander joins the game
    Then the seat of the app is Blue
    And the towers on the app's map are 5
    When the commander selects the first Blue drone
    Then the selected drone is the first Blue drone
    And the unit panel of the app is shown
    When the commander sends the selected drone to the west tower
    Then the order of the first Blue drone is take the west tower
    When the game runs for 2 minutes
    Then the west tower on the Blue map is held by Blue

Story: Changing your mind
  As a commander of a team
  I want to stop a drone or call it back
  So that I can use it somewhere else

  You select a drone. You make it circle where it is, and then you send it back over the base.

  Scenario: Hold, then home
    When the commander selects the first Blue drone
    When the commander holds the selected drone
    Then the order of the first Blue drone is hold
    When the commander sends the selected drone home
    Then the order of the first Blue drone is go home

Story: Watch your drone on the battlefield
  As a commander of a team
  I want to move the camera over the battlefield
  So that I see my drones where they fight

  The camera starts over your base. You select a drone, move the camera to the west tower with the
  minimap, and send the drone there. When the tower is yours, you turn the camera and bring it back
  to the drone.

  Scenario: Follow a drone to the west tower
    When the commander joins the game
    Then the point of the battlefield camera is the Blue base
    When the commander selects the first Blue drone
    Then the selected drone is the first Blue drone
    When the commander clicks the west tower on the minimap
    Then the point of the battlefield camera is the west tower
    When the commander sends the selected drone to the west tower
    Then the order of the first Blue drone is take the west tower
    When the game runs for 2 minutes
    Then the west tower on the Blue map is held by Blue
    And the first Blue drone is in the west circle
    When the commander turns the battlefield camera to the right
    Then the heading of the battlefield camera is 45 deg
    When the commander centres the battlefield on the selected drone
    Then the point of the battlefield camera is the west tower
